Z||000000||88/2.8||11-07-2000||05:20 PM||||does anyone have an accell super coil in thier fiero? Are they worth 50$? Did it improve performance for you?||||reg||5
Z||000001||mshill||11-07-2000||05:57 PM||||I have one.  I think I paid $40 for it.  I don't know if there is any performance gain over stock.  If there is it is probably above 4000 RPM, and I don't do too much hard driving up in that range.||||reg||1
Z||000002||88/2.8||11-07-2000||06:04 PM||||Ok, thanks i think the place i was going to get it from wanted 50$||||reg||7
Z||000003||rogergarrison||11-07-2000||07:53 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 88/2.8:<BR><B>Ok, thanks i think the place i was going to get it from wanted 50$</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>I have one on my v6 turbo, works fine, no miss or any probs up to 7000 rpm. I think I paid $49 at Jegs Automotive. Its a direct bold in replacement. (wish it was red to match everything else in eng compt).<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000004||88formula||11-07-2000||08:30 PM||||The MSD coil is the same thing and it's cheaper. Part number is MSD #8226. ||||reg||1
Z||000005||stimpy||11-08-2000||01:15 AM||||I had one put in my car when I had my eng rebuilt. I went the "over-engineered" route.  Maybe it doesn't do anything, but I don't think I'll ever have a problem with not enough spark.  Oh, and my engine is yellow, so it matches, hehehe... <BR>||||reg||1
Z||000006||1FST2M6||11-08-2000||11:34 AM||||the Super coil works well with both the Crane Hi-6s and the MSD 6al GT Bastard still is using it. I was very happy with it's performance. but am using a Crane PS92 for the GT just cause of space constraints.||||reg||1
